[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:Come In, Amy.]
[00:00.66]Lesson 29 | 第29课
[00:02.79]Come in, Amy. | 进来吧，艾米。
[00:05.90]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答问题。
[00:11.77]How must Amy clean the floor? | 艾米必须怎样打扫地板？
[00:16.35]Come in, Amy. | 进来吧，艾米。
[00:19.36]Shut the door, please. | 请把门关上。
[00:22.02]This bedroom's very untidy. | 这间卧室真不整洁。
[00:26.33]What must I do, Mrs. Jones? | 琼斯夫人，我必须做什么？
[00:30.24]Open the window and air the room. | 把窗户打开，让房间通通风。
[00:34.02]Then put these clothes in the wardrobe. | 然后把这些衣服放进衣柜里。
[00:39.56]Then make the bed. | 然后铺床。
[00:42.19]Dust the dressing table. | 擦拭梳妆台。
[00:45.33]Then sweep the floor. | 然后扫地。